# Trunk wasm build output (the web simulator). Built from source by CI for the site.
dist/

# The web demo's bundled map / route / track are embedded into the wasm via
# include_bytes!, so they must be committed — re-include them over the repo-wide
# *.obcm / *.obcr / *.gpx ignore rules in the root .gitignore.
!assets/*.obcm
!assets/*.obcr
!assets/*.gpx
